You told us before that you'd support us
if we weren't school idols, right?

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:03.280
It's not like you don't like us
or you were trying to be mean, right?

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:06.410
We want to know why.
If you could tell us that,

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:09.660
I'm sure we can all help you
figure something out.

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:14.540
I don't know if you'd
ever be able to accept us,

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:18.130
but we really don't think
school idols are bad.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.250
There really isn't a reason.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:29.140
It's just this school is better off
without school idols.

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.510
That is how I feel.

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:41.110
What do you mean it'd be better off?

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.780
And now, our first student
council president,

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:48.490
Ren Hazuki-san, will say a few words.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:51.330
Hello, I am Ren Hazuki,

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.460
and I have been chosen to be this school's
first student council president.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:59.920
I am truly honored to be chosen
for such a prestigious position

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.250
and very humbled.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:09.340
I will do everything in my power
so that Yuigaoka Girls' High

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:15.980
can become an established school
in this area for a very long time.

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.690
To make that happen...

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:23.270
I wonder what's wrong.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:31.450
To make that happen,
our first school festival

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:34.870
will have the music program
as the main act.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.210
Hazuki-san...

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:46.550
She totally broke her campaign promise.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:49.590
Yeah. All of us have been
looking forward to the school festival

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.050
and have been planning
what to do with our classes.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:54.720
Apparently, the class next door
is collecting signatures to fight this.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.180
Oh, I'm definitely going
to help out with that.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:03.480
There's a quicker solution than that.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:04.820
A recall!

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:05.860
Recall?

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.820
Yes. If that goes through,

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:10.990
the current president
will have to step down for lying.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:14.160
And then, after another election, I'll--

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.080
"Kanon Shibuya"

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.080
Kanon should be
the student council president!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.410
"Kanon Shibuya"

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.410
--Gala?
--What?
--Me?

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:18.870
Kanon-chan's going to run?

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.500
--What?!
--You have my support!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.500
We were actually talking about
how you'd be a great candidate!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.250
--Yeah!
--Nope. No way.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:30.260
That's not happening.
I mean, I don't stand out at all.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.840
You're just asking to be hated on.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:38.220
Huh? No, no, no. That's not what I meant!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:41.600
But you might just have to do that.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:44.650
Yes. She's already broken her promise,

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:48.900
so if we leave her alone, she's definitely
going to prohibit school idols.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:52.740
Hm... I guess I could see that.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:56.530
But there has to be some kind of a reason.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:16:00.250
But she wouldn't
tell you yesterday, right?

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.120
Well...

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.880
"Yuigaoka Girls' Private High School"

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:08.920
Now we're tailing her?

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:12.760
What else can we do? Apparently,
most of the kids in the music program

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.970
don't know much about Hazuki-san either.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.640
If we're doing this, we're going all in.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:28.940
That was close!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.570
That's Hazuki-san for you.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.900
She's always so proper
even out of the music program

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:35.320
and is always paying attention
to those around her.

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:38.910
So she has the ability
to sense someone's presence.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.710
In that case, Sumire-chan.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.630
Gala?

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.090
I definitely don't like this...

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.170
It's poop!

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.920
--Poop!
--Shut up!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.940
Way to go, Sumire-chan!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:09.940
You didn't get noticed at all!

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.780
Please spare the compliments. They hurt.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:12.990
Kanon!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.820
Let's go!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.460
She went in here.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.380
So this is...

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.630
Hazuki-san's house.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:39.260
I figured she was rich,
but this is out of this universe.

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.060
Well, let's call her out here.

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:42.060
Wait!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.850
We should investigate
a little more first...

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:47.770
Didn't we follow her
all the way here because

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:51.320
we wanted to find out more about her?

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.490
Who is it?

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:56.490
Oh, um, I--

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:59.700
We're students from Yuigaoka Girls' High.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.200
We wanted to talk to Ren-san.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.080
Here you are.

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.670
Thank you very much.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:15.510
I will go fetch Miss Ren.
Please make yourselves at home.

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.720
Okay.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.640
What are we going to do?
We just showed up unannounced.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:24.220
Well, we did follow her...

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.440
I wonder what we could
even say to Hazuki-san!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.310
--This is good.
--She's probably just going to get mad.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:35.570
Like, "I have nothing to say to you.
Go home. Begone."

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.950
Yeah...

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:43.120
This really is a lovely house, though.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:46.250
Look, there's a giant plushie.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.960
Plushie? It's not taxidermied?

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:52.090
A dog this big could never
exist in real life.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.000
Oh, it's so warm...

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.420
It's warm?

00:18:56.720 --> 00:19:00.970
You're right. And you can hear
something thumping...

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:05.810
What are you talking about?
There you go, making stuff up again.

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:09.810
It's...

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:10.900
It's...

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.520
It's real!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.820
What the heck is that ridiculous dog?!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.240
I don't know!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:20.610
Has it been genetically modified?!
Maybe it's been modified to be a giant!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.160
Found it!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.870
It really is an actual dog.

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.410
It's supposed to be that big?

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:28.250
Anyway, we just need to ask for help!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.250
Someone!

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.420
Someone!

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:32.210
Someone!

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.420
Someone!

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:35.800
There's no one here!

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.130
What's going on?

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.340
I can't!

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.800
Keke-chan!

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.390
Kanon-chan?!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:44.760
Hiyah!

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.890
--Hurry, get inside!
--Thanks!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.140
Yes!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:52.480
What's with this place?

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:55.730
I can't believe there's, like,
no one inside this giant house.

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:57.780
It is strange.

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.050
This is...

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:24.840
Kanon-chan.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.890
Is it a graduation photo?

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.970
It looks like Yuigaoka.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:31.390
But this photo's pretty old.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.150
No!

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:40.070
Thank you for everything you've done.
I'll never forget you.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.200
No, I cannot accept this.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:47.120
Please. We really don't have the money
to keep you working here next month.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:52.080
This is not necessary.
I just want to serve the Hazuki Family...

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:57.130
But that's not right. If I were
to have someone like you work for free,

00:20:57.130 --> 00:21:00.550
then my late mother
would never forgive me.

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:05.050
But... Then you truly
will be all alone, Miss Ren.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:08.680
I'll be all right.
I have Chibi, after all.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:10.270
Chibi? Really?

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.180
Shh!

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:16.350
I believe you first came here
around the time Chibi was just born.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:20.280
Back then, Father was still around
and my mother was healthy.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:24.650
We all got along and it was so lively...

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.490
Miss Ren...

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:29.030
It's not that I'm losing hope.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:34.750
I still have Yuigaoka
that Mother left me, after all.

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:35.870
Chibi?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.460
Who-- Huh?

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:42.800
--Ow...
--Hey, don't lick me there!

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:44.260
You...

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:47.470
Hey! That tickles!

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:49.050
Chibi, come.

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:53.350
Sit. Stay.

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:54.890
Did you hear everything?

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:58.520
What do you mean you're by yourself?
That you don't have any money...

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:05.030
It's exactly how it sounds. I am the
only one left here, and I have no money.

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:08.780
At this rate, the school can't keep going.

00:22:08.780 --> 00:22:14.540
I have to do whatever I can in order to
keep the school my mother left me going.

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:17.170
Hazuki-san...

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.920
<i>The future is calling to us</i>

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:27.760
<i>Like the wind</i>

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:33.970
<i>No one knows what the future holds for us</i>

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:38.310
<i>Even then, we want to move forward</i>

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:41.820
<i>Because we don't want to have any regrets</i>

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:45.440
<i>You can't hold down our hearts</i>

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:49.610
<i>Let's all be free</i>

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:53.080
<i>We're not going to give up!</i>

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:56.660
<i>Because we decided that</i>

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:59.710
<i>We'll cry, laugh, and do our best</i>

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:04.050
<i>We all want to surpass our limits</i>

00:23:04.050 --> 00:23:08.300
<i>It's important to believe</i>

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:11.850
<i>And once we told ourselves that</i>

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:18.850
<i>Let's try to go even further</i>

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:26.610
<i>We may be small, but we have big dreams</i>

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:33.700
<i>We won't give in, now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:41.290
<i>Let's fly the best we can,</i>
<i>now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:42.830 --> 00:23:46.210
Next time, "Connecting Feelings."
